{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "help-pr-mobile-apis-only",
    "name": "Help PR — Mobile APIs only",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`routes/mobile`** only (`/api/mobile/*`).\n\n**Partner app:** `POST /api/mobile/partner/register`, `POST /api/mobile/partner/login`\n\n**User app:** no routes in `routes/mobile/user` yet — folder reserved.\n\n**Setup:** Set `baseUrl` (e.g. `http://localhost:5001`). Run **Partner → Register** or **Login** (no auth). Token is saved from `data.auth_token` to `{{token}}`.\n\n**Password:** min 8 chars, upper, lower, number, special `@$!%*?&`\n\n**Email:** local part letters, digits, `.` `_` `-` only; domain with TLD (e.g. `.com`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner",
      "description": "Partner mobile app — `routes/mobile/partner/index.js`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Priya\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2003-05-23\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+916309654123\",\n  \"email\": \"partner.mobile+{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Priya@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "register"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/register**\n\n- No Authorization header\n- Response: `success`, `message`, `data` (user object; JWT in `data.auth_token`)\n- Pending partner: `data.is_active` false, `data.verification_status` 1"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_token\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "login"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/login**\n\n- No Authorization header\n- Allows pending partners (`is_active: false`) for onboarding\n- Response: `success`, `status`, `message`, `data` only (JWT in `data.auth_token`; use `data.verification_status`, `data.is_active`, `data.is_blocked` for app state)\n\nDo not use `/api/auth/login` for partner app — that blocks unapproved partners."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User",
      "description": "Customer mobile app — `routes/mobile/user/index.js` (no endpoints yet). Add requests here when `/api/mobile/user/*` routes are implemented.",
      "item": []
    }
  ],
